        'Suppresses the <link rel="wlwmanifest"> tag. Windows Live Writer was discontinued by Microsoft in 2012.' => 'Unterdrückt das <link rel="wlwmanifest">-Tag. Microsoft stellte Windows Live Writer 2012 ein.',
